<h1>About the Hobby</h1>
<p class="lead">Video games are our favorite way to relax, compete, and spend time with friends.</p>
<h4>Why we love it</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Stories and worlds that are different from everyday life</li>
    <li>Playing together with friends, online or on the couch</li>
    <li>Challenges that reward practice and strategy</li>
</ul>
<h4>How we play</h4>
<p>We play on PC and consoles. Our favorite genres include action-adventure, shooters, strategy, racing, and simulation.</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" asp-controller="Games" asp-action="Index">See our games</a>
